{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"OESA-2026-3132","published":"2026-07-24T11:12:00Z","modified":"2026-08-18T01:21:23.967494479Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-13606"],"summary":"GraphicsMagick security update","details":"GraphicsMagick is a comprehensive image processing package which is initially based on ImageMagick 5.5.2, but which has undergone significant re-work by the GraphicsMagick Group to significantly improve the quality and performance of the software.\r\n\r\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nA flaw was found in GraphicsMagick&apos;s Photo CD (PCD) decoder. A remote attacker could exploit this vulnerability by providing a specially crafted PCD file. This could lead to an out-of-bounds write, corrupting memory and potentially causing a denial of service or other unpredictable system behavior.(CVE-2026-13606)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"GraphicsMagick","ecosystem":"openEuler:20.03-LTS-SP4","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/GraphicsMagick&distro=openEuler-20.03-LTS-SP4"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.3.41-4.oe2003sp4"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"aarch64":["GraphicsMagick-1.3.41-4.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","GraphicsMagick-c++-1.3.41-4.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","GraphicsMagick-c++-devel-1.3.41-4.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","GraphicsMagick-debuginfo-1.3.41-4.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","GraphicsMagick-debugsource-1.3.41-4.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","GraphicsMagick-devel-1.3.41-4.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm","GraphicsMagick-perl-1.3.41-4.oe2003sp4.aarch64.rpm"],"noarch":["GraphicsMagick-help-1.3.41-4.oe2003sp4.noarch.rpm"],"src":["GraphicsMagick-1.3.41-4.oe2003sp4.src.rpm"],"x86_64":["GraphicsMagick-1.3.41-4.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm","GraphicsMagick-c++-1.3.41-4.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm","GraphicsMagick-c++-devel-1.3.41-4.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm","GraphicsMagick-debuginfo-1.3.41-4.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm","GraphicsMagick-debugsource-1.3.41-4.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm","GraphicsMagick-devel-1.3.41-4.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm","GraphicsMagick-perl-1.3.41-4.oe2003sp4.x86_64.rpm"]},"database_specific